"Celena North High, CNH, is Celena North University's feeder high school in Apex."
"Its classes are mostly in English, and it has a School for the Arts."
"CNH caps B-rank acceptances at 25% for most programs and 5% for the hero course."
"The hero track requires an entrance physical, interviews, and power and combat assessments."
"Hero-track quarters carry higher credit requirements than other programs."
"Its hero course is closely tied to Celena North University's college hero program."
"CNH has student dorms, which Alden planned to move into."
